<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Your OTP Code</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f6f9; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background: #1a1a2e; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .body { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .body p { color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .otp-box { background: #f0f4ff; border: 2px dashed #4f6ef7; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; }
    .otp-code { font-size: 38px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 10px; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .expiry { color: #888; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .footer { background: #f4f6f9; padding: 16px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .footer p { color: #aaa; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Thalorix</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>Use the code below to complete your <strong>{{action}}</strong>. This code is valid for <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p>
      <div class="otp-box">
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
        <div class="expiry">Expires in 10 minutes</div>
      </div>
      <p>If you didn't request this code, you can safely ignore this email. Do not share it with anyone.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} Thalorix. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
